{"id":"b44315ceaa149e64","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/083_结构演算_Calculus_of_Structures.md","title":"083 结构演算 Calculus of Structures","display":"083_结构演算_Calculus_of_Structures","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-公式与结构符号\">1. 公式与结构符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。结构构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad natm,\\quad top,\\quad bot,\\quad par,\\quad copar.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad natm,\\quad top,\\quad bot,\\quad par,\\quad copar.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Str_S\">\\(Str_S\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Str_S\">\\(atm(p)\\in Str_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"natm(p)\\in Str_S\">\\(natm(p)\\in Str_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"top\\in Str_S\">\\(top\\in Str_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\\in Str_S\">\\(bot\\in Str_S\\)</span>，二者为不同的零元构造子。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in Str_S\">\\(S,T\\in Str_S\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(S,T)\\in Str_S\">\\(par(S,T)\\in Str_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in Str_S\">\\(S,T\\in Str_S\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"copar(S,T)\\in Str_S\">\\(copar(S,T)\\in Str_S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm\">\\(atm\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"natm\">\\(natm\\)</span> 是带极性的原子构造子。</p>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：推理规则在结构上下文的任意深度位置重写结构，而不是在相继式左右侧之间移动公式。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-原子、替换与对偶\">2. 原子、替换与对偶</h1>\n<p>原子出现函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"At_S:Str_S\\to\\mathcal P(Prop)\">\\(At_S:Str_S\\to\\mathcal P(Prop)\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_S(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad At_S(natm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad At_S(top)=At_S(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_S(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad At_S(natm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad At_S(top)=At_S(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_S(par(S,T))=At_S(S)\\cup At_S(T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_S(par(S,T))=At_S(S)\\cup At_S(T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_S(copar(S,T))=At_S(S)\\cup At_S(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_S(copar(S,T))=At_S(S)\\cup At_S(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_S=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Str_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_S=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Str_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>结构替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_S\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_S\\)</span> 的正负扩张同时定义。正扩张为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma^+(natm(p))=dual_S(\\sigma(p)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma^+(natm(p))=dual_S(\\sigma(p)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(top)=top,\\qquad \\widehat\\sigma^+(bot)=bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(top)=top,\\qquad \\widehat\\sigma^+(bot)=bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(par(S,T))=par(\\widehat\\sigma^+(S),\\widehat\\sigma^+(T)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(par(S,T))=par(\\widehat\\sigma^+(S),\\widehat\\sigma^+(T)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^+(copar(S,T))=copar(\\widehat\\sigma^+(S),\\widehat\\sigma^+(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^+(copar(S,T))=copar(\\widehat\\sigma^+(S),\\widehat\\sigma^+(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>负扩张定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^-(S)=dual_S(\\widehat\\sigma^+(dual_S(S))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma^-(S)=dual_S(\\widehat\\sigma^+(dual_S(S))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对偶函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual_S(atm(p))=natm(p),\\quad dual_S(natm(p))=atm(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual_S(atm(p))=natm(p),\\quad dual_S(natm(p))=atm(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual_S(top)=bot,\\quad dual_S(bot)=top,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual_S(top)=bot,\\quad dual_S(bot)=top,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual_S(par(S,T))=copar(dual_S(S),dual_S(T)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual_S(par(S,T))=copar(dual_S(S),dual_S(T)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual_S(copar(S,T))=par(dual_S(S),dual_S(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual_S(copar(S,T))=par(dual_S(S),dual_S(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为结构字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-结构上下文\">3. 结构上下文</h1>\n<p>单洞结构上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SCtx\">\\(SCtx\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"hole\\in SCtx\">\\(hole\\in SCtx\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in SCtx\">\\(C\\in SCtx\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in Str_S\">\\(S\\in Str_S\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(C,S)\">\\(par(C,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(S,C)\">\\(par(S,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"copar(C,S)\">\\(copar(C,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"copar(S,C)\">\\(copar(S,C)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SCtx\">\\(SCtx\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填洞函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_S:SCtx\\times Str_S\\to Str_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_S:SCtx\\times Str_S\\to Str_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_S(hole,S)=S,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_S(hole,S)=S,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_S(par(C,T),S)=par(Plug_S(C,S),T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_S(par(C,T),S)=par(Plug_S(C,S),T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_S(par(T,C),S)=par(T,Plug_S(C,S)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_S(par(T,C),S)=par(T,Plug_S(C,S)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_S(copar(C,T),S)=copar(Plug_S(C,S),T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_S(copar(C,T),S)=copar(Plug_S(C,S),T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_S(copar(T,C),S)=copar(T,Plug_S(C,S)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_S(copar(T,C),S)=copar(T,Plug_S(C,S)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in SCtx\">\\(C\\in SCtx\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in Str_S\">\\(S,T\\in Str_S\\)</span>。这五个互斥的上下文构造子子句唯一确定洞的位置。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-结构同余\">4. 结构同余</h1>\n<p>结构同余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_S\">\\(\\equiv_S\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Str_S\">\\(Str_S\\)</span> 上满足下列条件的最小等价关系；以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,U\\in Str_S\">\\(S,T,U\\in Str_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in SCtx\">\\(C\\in SCtx\\)</span>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(S,T)\\equiv_S par(T,S)\">\\(par(S,T)\\equiv_S par(T,S)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"copar(S,T)\\equiv_S copar(T,S)\">\\(copar(S,T)\\equiv_S copar(T,S)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(par(S,T),U)\\equiv_S par(S,par(T,U))\">\\(par(par(S,T),U)\\equiv_S par(S,par(T,U))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"copar(copar(S,T),U)\\equiv_S copar(S,copar(T,U))\">\\(copar(copar(S,T),U)\\equiv_S copar(S,copar(T,U))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(S,bot)\\equiv_S S\">\\(par(S,bot)\\equiv_S S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"copar(S,top)\\equiv_S S\">\\(copar(S,top)\\equiv_S S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\equiv_S T\">\\(S\\equiv_S T\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Plug_S(C,S)\\equiv_S Plug_S(C,T)\">\\(Plug_S(C,S)\\equiv_S Plug_S(C,T)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"5.-基本结构规则\">5. 基本结构规则</h1>\n<p>所有基本规则均为结构到结构的二元关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ai},Rule_{sw},Rule_{med},Rule_w,Rule_c\n\\subseteq Str_S\\times Str_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{ai},Rule_{sw},Rule_{med},Rule_w,Rule_c\n\\subseteq Str_S\\times Str_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子相互作用规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ai}\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,top),Plug_S(C,par(atm(p),natm(p)))):C\\in SCtx,p\\in Prop\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{ai}\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,top),Plug_S(C,par(atm(p),natm(p)))):C\\in SCtx,p\\in Prop\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>开关规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{sw}\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,copar(par(S,T),U)),Plug_S(C,par(S,copar(T,U)))):\nC\\in SCtx,\\ S,T,U\\in Str_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{sw}\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,copar(par(S,T),U)),Plug_S(C,par(S,copar(T,U)))):\nC\\in SCtx,\\ S,T,U\\in Str_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>中介规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{med}\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,par(copar(S,T),copar(U,V))),Plug_S(C,copar(par(S,U),par(T,V)))):\nC\\in SCtx,\\ S,T,U,V\\in Str_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{med}\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,par(copar(S,T),copar(U,V))),Plug_S(C,copar(par(S,U),par(T,V)))):\nC\\in SCtx,\\ S,T,U,V\\in Str_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-结构弱化与收缩\">6. 结构弱化与收缩</h1>\n<p>弱化规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_w\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,bot),Plug_S(C,S)):C\\in SCtx,S\\in Str_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_w\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,bot),Plug_S(C,S)):C\\in SCtx,S\\in Str_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>收缩规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_c\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,par(S,S)),Plug_S(C,S)):C\\in SCtx,S\\in Str_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_c\n=\n\\{(Plug_S(C,par(S,S)),Plug_S(C,S)):C\\in SCtx,S\\in Str_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{CoS}=Rule_{ai}\\cup Rule_{sw}\\cup Rule_{med}\\cup Rule_w\\cup Rule_c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{CoS}=Rule_{ai}\\cup Rule_{sw}\\cup Rule_{med}\\cup Rule_w\\cup Rule_c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始结构对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{CoS}=\\{top\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{CoS}=\\{top\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-结构推导\">7. 结构推导</h1>\n<p>从结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 到结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的结构推导是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(S_0,\\ldots,S_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(S_0,\\ldots,S_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0=S\">\\(S_0=S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{m-1}=T\">\\(S_{m-1}=T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+1&lt;m\">\\(i+1&lt;m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S_i,S_{i+1})\\in Rule_{CoS}\">\\((S_i,S_{i+1})\\in Rule_{CoS}\\)</span>，或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\\equiv_S S_{i+1}\">\\(S_i\\equiv_S S_{i+1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{CoS}(S,T,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{CoS}(S,T,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Str_S\n\\wedge\n\\pi(0)=S\n\\wedge\n\\pi(m-1)=T\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\bigl((\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in Rule_{CoS}\\vee \\pi(i)\\equiv_S\\pi(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Str_S\n\\wedge\n\\pi(0)=S\n\\wedge\n\\pi(m-1)=T\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\bigl((\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in Rule_{CoS}\\vee \\pi(i)\\equiv_S\\pi(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可推出关系\">8. 可推出关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash_{CoS}T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\vdash_{CoS}T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{CoS}(S,T,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{CoS}(S,T,\\pi)\\)</span>。定义可证结构集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_{CoS}=\\{S\\in Str_S:\\exists I\\in Init_{CoS}\\ I\\vdash_{CoS}S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_{CoS}=\\{S\\in Str_S:\\exists I\\in Init_{CoS}\\ I\\vdash_{CoS}S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标区分对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{CoS}\n=\n(SCtx,Plug_S,\\equiv_S,Rule_{ai},Rule_{sw},Rule_{med},Rule_w,Rule_c,\\vdash_{CoS}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{CoS}\n=\n(SCtx,Plug_S,\\equiv_S,Rule_{ai},Rule_{sw},Rule_{med},Rule_w,Rule_c,\\vdash_{CoS}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个基本规则已由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Plug_S\">\\(Plug_S\\)</span> 闭包到任意结构深度；这正是本条目区别于只在根相继式应用规则的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非退化边界与不变式\">非退化边界与不变式</h2>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:Prop\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:Prop\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，递归定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_v:Str_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b_v:Str_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_v(top)=1,\\quad b_v(bot)=0,\\quad b_v(atm(p))=v(p),\\quad b_v(natm(p))=1-v(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_v(top)=1,\\quad b_v(bot)=0,\\quad b_v(atm(p))=v(p),\\quad b_v(natm(p))=1-v(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_v(copar(A,B))=\\min(b_v(A),b_v(B)),\\qquad\nb_v(par(A,B))=\\max(b_v(A),b_v(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_v(copar(A,B))=\\min(b_v(A),b_v(B)),\\qquad\nb_v(par(A,B))=\\max(b_v(A),b_v(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全部同余生成式保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_v\">\\(b_v\\)</span>；每个局部规则使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_v(\\text{前})\\le b_v(\\text{后})\">\\(b_v(\\text{前})\\le b_v(\\text{后})\\)</span>。其中 switch 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s\\lor t)\\land u\\to s\\lor(t\\land u)\">\\((s\\lor t)\\land u\\to s\\lor(t\\land u)\\)</span>（变量重排的等价形式亦同），medial 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\land b)\\lor(d\\land e)\\to(a\\lor d)\\land(b\\lor e)\">\\((a\\land b)\\lor(d\\land e)\\to(a\\lor d)\\land(b\\lor e)\\)</span>，二者由布尔分配律直接推出。弱化的源是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\">\\(bot\\)</span>，原子相互作用产生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\lor\\neg p\">\\(p\\lor\\neg p\\)</span>；收缩保持同值。</p>\n<p>对单洞上下文的构造高度归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_v\">\\(b_v\\)</span> 对洞值单调；因此上述不变式提升到任意深度的规则。再对实际有限证明长度归纳，从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"top\">\\(top\\)</span> 出发的每个可证对象都对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。这给出全称的非退化论证，有限枚举仅作规则核对。</p>\n<p>正例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"top\">\\(top\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"par(atm(p),natm(p))\">\\(par(atm(p),natm(p))\\)</span> 可证；负例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\">\\(bot\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\">\\(atm(p)\\)</span> 不可证（后者取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(p)=0\">\\(v(p)=0\\)</span>）。原单单位直接弱化 top→atm(p) 已无合法实例。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CalculusOfStructures}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nStr_S,\nAt_S,\nSub_S,\n\\widehat\\sigma^+,\n\\widehat\\sigma^-,\ndual_S,\nSCtx,\nPlug_S,\n\\equiv_S,\nRule_{ai},\nRule_{sw},\nRule_{med},\nRule_w,\nRule_c,\nRule_{CoS},\nInit_{CoS},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{CoS},\n\\vdash_{CoS},\nThm_{CoS},\n\\Delta_{CoS}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CalculusOfStructures}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nStr_S,\nAt_S,\nSub_S,\n\\widehat\\sigma^+,\n\\widehat\\sigma^-,\ndual_S,\nSCtx,\nPlug_S,\n\\equiv_S,\nRule_{ai},\nRule_{sw},\nRule_{med},\nRule_w,\nRule_c,\nRule_{CoS},\nInit_{CoS},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{CoS},\n\\vdash_{CoS},\nThm_{CoS},\n\\Delta_{CoS}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含结构、单洞上下文、深处结构重写和有限结构推导；不含相继式左右侧、显示公设或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-公式与结构符号","text":"1. 公式与结构符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-原子、替换与对偶","text":"2. 原子、替换与对偶","level":1},{"id":"3.-结构上下文","text":"3. 结构上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-结构同余","text":"4. 结构同余","level":1},{"id":"5.-基本结构规则","text":"5. 基本结构规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-结构弱化与收缩","text":"6. 结构弱化与收缩","level":1},{"id":"7.-结构推导","text":"7. 结构推导","level":1},{"id":"8.-可推出关系","text":"8. 可推出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异","text":"9. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"非退化边界与不变式","text":"非退化边界与不变式","level":2},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","d